(6359342, 941602, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this for a long time- because it''s good. After a while those two dark patches in the central foreground don''t seem to quite blend as they should.<br/>That''s a nit-pic though because overall the shot manages to convey both impact and calm simultaneously.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this for a long time- because it''s good. After a while those two dark patches in the central foreground don''t seem to quite blend as they should.That''s a nit-pic though because overall the shot manages to convey both impact and calm simultaneously.', '2011-03-21 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
