(6359471, 941726, 112739, '<td valign="top">The postures, the lake setting (I''ve seen that before in another image that won blue), the creativity, the high quality of this work has be Gyaban. I like everything except the fog that should be seen in front of the figures, in other words the mist should have been painted out of the figures. Maybe it was by design? Either way, there are so many awesome elements I have to give it my 10.</td>', 'The postures, the lake setting (I''ve seen that before in another image that won blue), the creativity, the high quality of this work has be Gyaban. I like everything except the fog that should be seen in front of the figures, in other words the mist should have been painted out of the figures. Maybe it was by design? Either way, there are so many awesome elements I have to give it my 10.', '2011-03-21 22:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
