(6360232, 941661, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Blues. I like the effect of the intensified contrast of the moon''s lights vs darks. The tree  and the waves in the water really make this shot pop.</td>', 'Beautiful Blues. I like the effect of the intensified contrast of the moon''s lights vs darks. The tree  and the waves in the water really make this shot pop.', '2011-03-22 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360233, 941433, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp definition on the subject. Interesting and unexpected crop choice.</td>', 'Nice and crisp definition on the subject. Interesting and unexpected crop choice.', '2011-03-22 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360234, 941803, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting haziness to this one. I really like the purple hues.</td>', 'Interesting haziness to this one. I really like the purple hues.', '2011-03-22 20:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360237, 941626, 60047, '<td valign="top">I wish the moon was a more prominent feature. But it is a major player. The yellow of the moon compliments the blues of the sky quite well. I really like the use of the industrial plant and the way the light plays on its surfaces.</td>', 'I wish the moon was a more prominent feature. But it is a major player. The yellow of the moon compliments the blues of the sky quite well. I really like the use of the industrial plant and the way the light plays on its surfaces.', '2011-03-22 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360238, 941455, 60047, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Simple and elegant. Just on the verge of being a tad noisy.Nice definition on the moon''s surface features.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Simple and elegant. Just on the verge of being a tad noisy.Nice definition on the moon''s surface features.', '2011-03-22 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360240, 941300, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the framing of the structures and the different colors. I think this would have benefited from a bit of dodging on the moon itself.</td>', 'I really enjoy the framing of the structures and the different colors. I think this would have benefited from a bit of dodging on the moon itself.', '2011-03-22 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360241, 941501, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of crop. Lots of negative space emphasized by the border. A bit soft focused on the subject - was this intentional?</td>', 'Interesting choice of crop. Lots of negative space emphasized by the border. A bit soft focused on the subject - was this intentional?', '2011-03-22 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360242, 941610, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the cloud illumination along with the silhouette of the trees. Interesting choice of crop and moon placement.</td>', 'Love the cloud illumination along with the silhouette of the trees. Interesting choice of crop and moon placement.', '2011-03-22 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360248, 941840, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love the South Pacific feel of this shot. I really like the amber hues. Wondering about the one bright spot you''ve created on the moon itself. Fascinating choice of color on the border lines - I would not have thought of that and I think it compliments the amber tones. Nice work.</td>', 'I love the South Pacific feel of this shot. I really like the amber hues. Wondering about the one bright spot you''ve created on the moon itself. Fascinating choice of color on the border lines - I would not have thought of that and I think it compliments the amber tones. Nice work.', '2011-03-22 20:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360250, 941608, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The silhouette of the tower is superb. I wish that tip of the moon weren''t so blown.</td>', 'Great idea. The silhouette of the tower is superb. I wish that tip of the moon weren''t so blown.', '2011-03-22 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360255, 941503, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a surreal effect to have such a sharp moon in such a soft bed of clouds. The moon itself is notably contrasty with dark darks and bright whites. The burning in the clouds is pretty noticeable and somewhat heavy handed. A fascinating and original answer to the challenge.</td>', 'Wow - what a surreal effect to have such a sharp moon in such a soft bed of clouds. The moon itself is notably contrasty with dark darks and bright whites. The burning in the clouds is pretty noticeable and somewhat heavy handed. A fascinating and original answer to the challenge.', '2011-03-22 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360257, 941611, 60047, '<td valign="top">A superb answer to this challenge. Really wonderfully executed and refreshingly unique.</td>', 'A superb answer to this challenge. Really wonderfully executed and refreshingly unique.', '2011-03-22 21:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360260, 941726, 60047, '<td valign="top">When I see "Expert Editing" as an option, this is the kind of work I expect to have to compete against. This is beautifully composed, very well executed and worthy of the ribbon page. Flawless.</td>', 'When I see "Expert Editing" as an option, this is the kind of work I expect to have to compete against. This is beautifully composed, very well executed and worthy of the ribbon page. Flawless.', '2011-03-22 21:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360266, 941561, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great high contrast shot.The trees are awesome. The moon is blown out. The bank between the water and the trees looks a little funky. Yet you''ve made the most of what you were working with. Nice composition.</td>', 'A great high contrast shot.The trees are awesome. The moon is blown out. The bank between the water and the trees looks a little funky. Yet you''ve made the most of what you were working with. Nice composition.', '2011-03-22 21:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360273, 941804, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the wet cement and the way the light reflects off of it. A wonderfully dark composition.</td>', 'Love the wet cement and the way the light reflects off of it. A wonderfully dark composition.', '2011-03-22 21:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360281, 941765, 60047, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, man! Those eyes are freaking me out! What a fascinating positioning of her hands - I''m left wondering if she''s about to pull her head off her neck.... Eerily smooth skin (except for the neck). You''ve done a tremendous job at taking advantage of the Expert Editing. Very well done.</td>', 'Oh wow, man! Those eyes are freaking me out! What a fascinating positioning of her hands - I''m left wondering if she''s about to pull her head off her neck.... Eerily smooth skin (except for the neck). You''ve done a tremendous job at taking advantage of the Expert Editing. Very well done.', '2011-03-22 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360287, 941848, 60047, '<td valign="top">What an interesting choice of composition and focus placement. I''m finding the High Voltage sign and it''s mount to be unexpectedly interesting to look at. The moon and it''s bizarre spotty halo is almost an afterthought. A ruggedly individualistic submission!</td>', 'What an interesting choice of composition and focus placement. I''m finding the High Voltage sign and it''s mount to be unexpectedly interesting to look at. The moon and it''s bizarre spotty halo is almost an afterthought. A ruggedly individualistic submission!', '2011-03-22 21:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360292, 941392, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflections. Nice blues. Love the light play on the chain. Interesting in that everything in the shot is crisp except for the challenge subject.</td>', 'Great use of reflections. Nice blues. Love the light play on the chain. Interesting in that everything in the shot is crisp except for the challenge subject.', '2011-03-22 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360295, 941356, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite a wild looking shot. If you hadn''t informed me of the twilight, I would have thought this was taken in broad daylight.</td>', 'Quite a wild looking shot. If you hadn''t informed me of the twilight, I would have thought this was taken in broad daylight.', '2011-03-22 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
