(6757035, 941502, 97225, '<td valign="top">Exceptional shot, Richard. I see I gave you a 9 but left no comment. At the time I wouldn''t have realized it was a straight shot, being in a challenge full of manipulation. <br/>It''s interesting to read your notes about altitude and colour. I live at 1525 feet above sea level and the moon is usually fairly silver. Occasionally though it rises very yellow - it must depend on whatever is going on in the atmosphere.</td>', 'Exceptional shot, Richard. I see I gave you a 9 but left no comment. At the time I wouldn''t have realized it was a straight shot, being in a challenge full of manipulation. It''s interesting to read your notes about altitude and colour. I live at 1525 feet above sea level and the moon is usually fairly silver. Occasionally though it rises very yellow - it must depend on whatever is going on in the atmosphere.', '2012-05-01 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
